{{define "html"}}{{template "badge.info" "Account"}}
{{template "title" "Your account is ready"}}
<p>Hello{{if .Username}} {{.Username}}{{end}},</p>
<p>An administrator created an account for you on <strong>{{.Realm}}</strong>. To start, choose your password. The link below works once and expires in <strong>{{.ExpiresIn}}</strong>.</p>
{{template "button" (button .ResetURL "Choose my password")}}
{{template "link" .ResetURL}}
<p>If the link has expired, ask your administrator for a new one.</p>
{{template "muted" "If you were not expecting this, you can ignore this e-mail: nobody can use the account until a password is chosen with this link."}}
